## Three forms, echoed

``` {.lmd .code-with-copy}
local unmarked = pandoc.Nodes({pandoc.Para({pandoc.Strong({pandoc.Str("hello")})})})
local blocks = pandoc.Blocks({pandoc.Para({pandoc.Strong({pandoc.Str("hello")})})})
local inlines = pandoc.Inlines({pandoc.Strong({pandoc.Str("hello")})})
local strong = pandoc.Strong(pandoc.Inlines({pandoc.Emph({pandoc.Str("inner")})}))
return pandoc.Div({ unmarked, blocks, pandoc.Para(inlines), pandoc.Para({ strong }) }, pandoc.Attr("", {"box"}))
```

::: box
**hello**

**hello**

**hello**

***inner***
:::

